      "problem": "Consider the functions $y(x)=Ax$ and $f(y)=By,$ where $x\\in {R}^{3},y\\in {R}^{2},$ and the matrices $A$ and $B$ are given by\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -2 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat is $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}f(y(x))$ evaluated at ${x}_{0}=[2,\\,-1,\\,1]^{T}?$\n\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"30px\" height=\"70px\" align=\"center\">\n${\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}f(y(x))|}_{{x}_{0}}=\\,\\,$\n</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"35px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n\n<td width=\"30px\" align=\"center\">{{field-1}}</td>\n\n<td width=\"30px\" align=\"center\">{{field-2}}</td>\n\n<td width=\"30px\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n\n<td width=\"5px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr> \n\n<td height=\"35px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n{{field-3}}\n</td>\n\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-4}}</td>\n\n<td align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>",
